---

Kill a [L_Ender’s Cataclysm](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm) boss. It drops dust that matches the fight. Eat the dust. You get potion-like effects even if your hunger bar is full.

That is the player loop. You do not craft the regular dust. You earn it.

The eight bosses that drop it:

- Maledictus
- Ancient Remnant
- Ender Guardian
- Scylla
- Netherite Monstrosity
- Ignis
- The Leviathan
- The Harbinger

Eat Ignis dust before you walk back into a fire arena. Eat something with regen after a sloppy kill. Do not eat the whole stack on the spawn pad “just in case.” The effects are the point, not a permanent upgrade. Permanent hearts are the [overcharged](/mods/cataclysm-dedust/overcharged-dust) versions.

Advancements track first dust, all eight regulars, first overcharged, and all eight overcharged. They are checkboxes, not a skill tree.
